is opinion as  the character lies very close to his  heart now under the direction of Justice  League producer Charles rovin A  screenwriter is being sought as is a  director who would like to handle the  directing Christopher Macquarie is  particularly high up on the list of  possible contenders although at this  time he has his hands full with Mission  Impossible 7 and 8 making a take on the  project rather unlikely speaking of time  Henry Cavill also has a packed schedule  at the moment which is mainly down to  his leading role in The Witcher series  if many substantial rumors are to be  believed Cabell will be making at least  a cameo appearance in Black Adam which  hit theaters on October 21st in fact  Dwayne Johnson did not grow tired of  mentioning his fellow actor and his  character at every opportunity during  the hot promo phase of Black Adam  Johnson also wishes for a Black Adam vs  Superman movie in which the two Clash  something that is said to have been  obstructed under departing DC boss  Walter Hamada so far regardless a black  Superman movie is also believed to be in  the works under production by JJ Abrams  The Hollywood Reporter further talked  about Matt Reeves in his plans for the  expansion of the Batman Universe so far  we know about the Batman 2 and an Arkham  Asylum as well as a Penguin series but  the plans won't stop there Reeves is  currently looking for screenwriters and  directors to produce further movie  spin-offs from the world of Gotham City  among them should also be rather unknown  but bizarre characters such as Clayface  scarecrow or Professor Pig assuming that  these movies will be as gloomy as the  Batman we can look forward to some very  unsettling flicks Professor Pig in  particular will live up to his name as  he enjoys kidnapping people to turn them  into slaves and human animal hybrids by  means of cruel operations besides  various Batman projects the completion  of the script for Wonder Woman 3 is also  imminent an additional key player in  future DC films is the suicide squad  director James Gunn together with  Aquaman and Shazam producer Peter Safran  he will soon be working on a new DC  project although at present he is still  busy finishing Peacemaker season two  what kind of future project it will be  and if there is any connection to the  suicide squad is unfortunately unclear  news on a possible but flash sequel is  also available after leading actor Ezra  Miller accumulated one scandal after the  other over a long period of time he  recently returned to the set for  reshoots and has publicly apologized the  script for a sequel is reported to have  already been completed by Aquaman and  the lost kingdom author David Leslie  Johnson McGoldrick the only question  remaining is whether Miller will also  start in the sequel so far Warner  Brothers has stood by Miller in spite of  his escapades yet the 30-year-old is  still awaiting trial in January for  burglary which could even send him to  prison should he be found guilty so it  remains exciting at DC and Warner  Brothers at least there are now some  movies and Series in the works that fans  can look forward to after the Strategic  realignment under Warner CEO David  zaslot and the cancellation of Batgirl  and scoob too  since August the new She-Hulk Series has  been available on Disney plus before its  release the series made negative  headlines due to a trailer with bad CGI  and thus the signs were anything but  good as is now reflected in the viewer  ratings while many critics like at least  a few aspects of the series the opinions  of the majority of MCU fans were  anything but positive overall without  going into detail we must admit that the  general reception is mediocre at best  now the big question is what's next for  She-Hulk and Title Character Jennifer  Walters after the brilliant finale if we  look at the general series policy within  the MCU it is noticeable that only very  few series actually get the chance for a  second season including the Beloved Loki  series for example even lead actress  Tatiana mazlani considers the chance for  a second season to be slim as she  recently acknowledged in an interview of  extra internally she had not heard  anything about a second season likewise  conceivable and in our view no not  unlikely is an appearance of Jennifer  Walters AKA She-Hulk in one of the  upcoming Marvel movies perhaps even with  her cousin Bruce Banner or her ex-client  Abomination one possible appearance  would be in Captain America New World  Order since actor Tim Blake Nelson also  shows up there as leader at the moment  we unfortunately have little choice but  to resort to speculations so we hope to  get an official announcement for Marvel  very soon what are your thoughts on the  She-Hulk series do you like the new MCU  character and would you consider  watching a second season or are you  among the fans who were let down by the  performance feel free to let us know in  the comments  whip The Equalizer a rather brutal and  emotional Blockbuster was released in  2014 with Denzel Washington in the  leading role even though the four years  later released sequel could not build on  its popular predecessor without flaws a  third film was commissioned right away  last month director Antoine Fuqua  revealed that in The Equalizer 3 we will  learn more about the past of the main  character Robert McCall in addition  there will be a change of scenery as  most of the action will now take place  in Europe more precisely in Italy will  McCall have to deal with the kosa Nostra  this time well as of this week there are  at least first images from the set on  the picturesque Amalfi Coast where  filming is currently underway in  addition to Washington co-stars Dakota  Fanning and Gaia scudilaro can both be  seen as well returning director Antoine  Fuqua also made sure to pose with his  actors in The snapshots so far so good  however the images do not allow us to  draw any conclusions about the storyline  as there are no known shots of the  appearing characters yet so for the time  being we will have to wait for more  information about the plot and a release  date has unfortunately not been set  either  are you thrilled about the latest MCU  and DC developments or are you more  curious about what's going to happen on  the desert Planet well if none of that's  enough for you we've got you covered  check out our brand new Deadpool 3 movie  preview and get excited for some  anti-hero action as always enjoy  watching and we hope to see you next  week  laughs  [Music]

